      <memberdef kind="define" id="version_8h_1a140615d75aad46c9270b4186db25987b" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>THRUST_VERSION</name>
        <initializer>300200</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The preprocessor macro <computeroutput>THRUST_VERSION</computeroutput> encodes the version number of the Thrust library as MMMmmmpp. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>THRUST_VERSION is formatted as <computeroutput>MMMmmmpp</computeroutput>, which differs from <computeroutput>CCCL_VERSION</computeroutput> that uses <computeroutput>MMMmmmppp</computeroutput>. <verbatim>   &lt;tt&gt;THRUST_VERSION % 100&lt;/tt&gt; is the sub-minor version.
   &lt;tt&gt;THRUST_VERSION / 100 % 1000&lt;/tt&gt; is the minor version.
   &lt;tt&gt;THRUST_VERSION / 100000&lt;/tt&gt; is the major version.
</verbatim> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="thrust/version.h" line="64" column="9" bodyfile="thrust/version.h" bodystart="64" bodyend="-1"/>
